WEBVTT

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:12.639
Kikou wa nori no warui

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.382
Watashi ga sanka suru

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:22.421
Hisabisa no doraibu de minna hai tenshon

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.287
Kare mo kuru no

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.889
Myaku ga ima wa nakutomo

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:32.630
Zettai ikimasu tomo

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:38.670
Sugoi sugoi pookaa faisu dato shitara

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.808
Aru yo nante

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:48.839
Umi wa hiyake suru kara, yama ni shiyou tte

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:58.413
Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shiteru

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:02.662
Doushite nano?

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:06.633
Konna ureshikute

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:14.438
Chigiresouna hodo waratte iru noni

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:22.982
Kare no senaka mite wa mune tsumaru

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:30.946
Taenai egao no utsu no naka de

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.194
Claire!

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:45.330
That woman...

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.444
What?! This place is out of range?!

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:00.115
Rachel!

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:15.864
Run!

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.466
Claire!

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:21.407
Teacher...

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:21.708
Are you all right?
Teacher...

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:22.333
Are you all right?

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:23.843
Yeah...

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.674
You don't look so well.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.003
I'm sorry, I'm fine.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.583
Are you sure? Do you want to
go to the nurse's office?

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:33.416
No, I just kind of dozed off...

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:37.722
A lot happened yesterday, so you don't
have to strain yourself, okay?

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:46.726
Episode #2
A Cruel Night

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:50.369
Where's Claire?!

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:55.508
I said run!

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.169
What are you doing?!

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:05.343
Rose...Rose...Rose...

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.019
Get up! Hurry!

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.255
I can't stand up.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:09.822
Rose!

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:10.290
Please stay with me! Please!
Rose!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.088
Please stay with me! Please!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.257
Kate!

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:20.795
No! No! NO!

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.231
Help!

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:30.337
Get away! Get away!

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:31.807
Let's get out of here!

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:34.472
Hurry, run!

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:35.348
Kate!

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:36.610
Hurry!
Kate!

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.347
Get up!

00:03:46.993 --> 00:03:49.095
Kate, you're bleeding!

00:03:49.095 --> 00:03:50.496
I'm all right.

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:51.998
I don't understand why my phone
doesn't work here.

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:53.625
Mine doesn't either.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:54.534
Damn...

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:55.068
Apply some pressure here.
Damn...

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:55.902
Apply some pressure here.

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:57.237
Were you bitten?

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.534
That freak!

00:03:58.771 --> 00:03:59.772
Was it a man?

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:02.342
A man? It sure didn't look like it.

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:03.343
Then what was it?

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:04.510
I have no idea.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.778
It's like it crept along on the ground.

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:09.942
First of all, it's that woman who
is the cause of it all.

00:04:10.717 --> 00:04:12.619
What was she saying to us?

00:04:12.619 --> 00:04:14.621
That we're dead.

00:04:14.621 --> 00:04:16.022
We're not dead.

00:04:16.022 --> 00:04:17.557
But that's what she said!

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:18.558
Don't cry!

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:19.559
But...
Don't cry!

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:20.827
Hey, we're all scared.

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:21.828
Rachel...
Hey, we're all scared.

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:23.329
Where did that woman go?

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:23.963
Dunno...

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:24.664
She just told us all that nonsense,
and now she's gone?!
Dunno...

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:26.154
She just told us all that nonsense,
and now she's gone?!

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:28.701
You're so annoying! Quit your crying!

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:29.969
Get a hold of yourself!

00:04:29.969 --> 00:04:31.402
I'm sorry...
Get a hold of yourself!

00:04:31.738 --> 00:04:33.606
We gotta think of a way out of here.

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:34.971
I'm thinking!
We gotta think of a way out of here.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.907
What?

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:40.809
He's back!

00:04:42.582 --> 00:04:43.879
Claire?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.357
Is it him?

00:04:55.695 --> 00:04:56.992
Claire?

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:00.662
What's going on?

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:06.071
Get off me!

00:05:06.339 --> 00:05:07.636
Rachel!

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:09.971
Run! Rachel!

00:05:17.183 --> 00:05:18.480
Rachel!

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:23.121
Run! Hurry, run!

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:26.088
Run!

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:28.084
Run, hurry!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.307
It's going to be okay now.

00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:51.743
No, it's not going to be okay!

00:05:51.918 --> 00:05:54.087
This wouldn't have happened if you didn't
say we should hide in a place like this!

00:05:54.087 --> 00:05:55.855
Complaining about it now isn't
gonna change anything!

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:57.924
Look at me! I'm a mess!

00:05:57.924 --> 00:05:59.992
Hey, I'm all dirty too.

00:05:59.992 --> 00:06:02.795
Don't compare me to you!
Do you have any idea how much this cost?!

00:06:02.795 --> 00:06:04.660
Hey, at least we're not dead.

00:06:06.899 --> 00:06:08.662
I wonder where Kate and Rose went?

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.098
I don't know...

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:13.428
Well, we can't hear their screams, so they
must have found a place to hide.

00:06:14.907 --> 00:06:16.374
Keep your head down!

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:20.505
Let's make for the other side of that fence.

00:06:21.647 --> 00:06:23.282
It's so high, we'll never get across.

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:25.685
We'll be easy to see if we take
the way we came in from.

00:06:25.685 --> 00:06:27.887
There's a major road on the other side.

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:29.821
We should be able to find a car or someone.

00:06:30.456 --> 00:06:30.923
Okay?

00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:31.924
No! That thing will catch us!
Okay?

00:06:31.924 --> 00:06:33.226
No! That thing will catch us!

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:34.853
Well, what are we going to do?

00:06:34.994 --> 00:06:37.430
We can't keep running until morning.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:38.727
Forget it!

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:44.166
Fine, if you don't want to go, I'll go myself.

00:06:44.504 --> 00:06:45.304
What?! No!

00:06:45.304 --> 00:06:46.139
You don't want to go, right?
What?! No!

00:06:46.139 --> 00:06:46.572
You don't want to go, right?
You're going to leave me to die!

00:06:46.572 --> 00:06:47.630
You're going to leave me to die!

00:06:48.608 --> 00:06:49.809
Well then, let's go...

00:06:49.809 --> 00:06:51.106
No!

00:06:51.944 --> 00:06:54.674
Please! Don't leave me!

00:06:55.314 --> 00:06:56.416
Rachel?

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:58.885
I'm so scared! I'm sick and tired of this!

00:06:58.885 --> 00:07:02.822
If you don't pull yourself together,
you're going to die! Die!

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:05.892
I never wanna go through that again!
I'm scared! I don't want to!

00:07:05.892 --> 00:07:07.519
I'm scared too!

00:07:08.327 --> 00:07:11.387
I don't want to go outside.
Let's just keep hiding here!

00:07:12.064 --> 00:07:12.298
Hey!

00:07:12.298 --> 00:07:13.065
If we keep quiet and don't move...
Hey!

00:07:13.065 --> 00:07:13.633
If we keep quiet and don't move...

00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:14.734
Hey! Get a hold of yourself!

00:07:14.734 --> 00:07:15.601
Please!

00:07:15.601 --> 00:07:16.302
Rachel!

00:07:16.302 --> 00:07:16.569
I can't!
Rachel!

00:07:16.569 --> 00:07:16.969
I can't!

00:07:16.969 --> 00:07:17.270
I can't!
Rachel, we're getting out of here!

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.205
I can't take it!
Rachel, we're getting out of here!

00:07:19.205 --> 00:07:21.673
We can't stick around to get
attacked by that thing again!

00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:24.811
If you and I work together, we can make it.

00:07:24.811 --> 00:07:26.711
I know we can make it out of here!

00:07:27.814 --> 00:07:29.611
We're not going to die in a place like this!

00:07:31.317 --> 00:07:32.306
CI...

00:07:48.034 --> 00:07:49.865
God, it's been two days in a row now...

00:07:52.004 --> 00:07:54.199
How many times have you been late this month?

00:07:56.776 --> 00:07:58.243
Are you okay?

00:07:58.744 --> 00:08:00.246
I wonder if I'm going to get in trouble?

00:08:00.246 --> 00:08:02.714
More importantly, have the members
of Grace noticed?

00:08:03.649 --> 00:08:06.552
Well, I have classes together
with Jessica and Kate.

00:08:06.552 --> 00:08:08.019
That sucks...

00:08:08.621 --> 00:08:10.248
I'm gonna get another ticket.

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:15.760
Rose Sheedy, may I have a moment?

00:08:17.196 --> 00:08:18.493
Yes...

00:08:19.365 --> 00:08:20.566
Rose...

00:08:20.566 --> 00:08:22.830
It's fine. I'll see you later.

00:08:25.137 --> 00:08:27.206
That shop is pretty expensive.

00:08:27.206 --> 00:08:28.441
Not to mention pretentious.

00:08:28.441 --> 00:08:29.308
But their clothes sure are cute.
Not to mention pretentious.

00:08:29.308 --> 00:08:30.309
But their clothes sure are cute.
Because Rachel's wardrobe comes from there?

00:08:30.309 --> 00:08:30.843
Because Rachel's wardrobe comes from there?

00:08:30.843 --> 00:08:32.140
It's Grace.

00:08:32.211 --> 00:08:34.547
Kate? That's not like her.

00:08:34.547 --> 00:08:36.082
Well, she is a member of Grace.

00:08:36.082 --> 00:08:37.950
Rose was late again.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:38.951
Really?

00:08:38.951 --> 00:08:40.119
Was Rachel late too?

00:08:40.119 --> 00:08:41.854
She didn't show up last night either.

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:43.014
Maybe she took the day off.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.175
It really is high when you're
standing right in front of it.

00:09:03.175 --> 00:09:06.303
I told you there was no way.
Plus, those things are up there too.

00:09:18.024 --> 00:09:19.625
It's Claire and Rachel,

00:09:19.625 --> 00:09:21.092
over by the fence.

00:09:42.815 --> 00:09:44.112
Rachel...

00:09:44.383 --> 00:09:45.680
Luke...

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:46.485
Morning.

00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:46.986
Did you just get here?
Morning.

00:09:46.986 --> 00:09:47.420
Did you just get here?

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.554
Yeah...

00:09:48.554 --> 00:09:50.021
What's wrong?

00:09:50.189 --> 00:09:50.957
What do you mean?

00:09:50.957 --> 00:09:51.457
Last night, I waited for you until 4:00
in the morning at Club J.
What do you mean?

00:09:51.457 --> 00:09:54.727
Last night, I waited for you until 4:00
in the morning at Club J.

00:09:54.727 --> 00:09:58.230
Oh, that's right! I'm sorry, I fell asleep.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:00.833
You're kidding! Too bad, the place
was really hopping!

00:10:00.833 --> 00:10:03.301
Sorry, but I'll be there next time.

00:10:04.203 --> 00:10:05.500
It's on Friday, right?

00:10:05.871 --> 00:10:07.506
Andrew's party.

00:10:07.506 --> 00:10:09.804
Oh, yeah.

00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:10.443
Are you going to go?

00:10:10.443 --> 00:10:11.043
Of course! It's going to be an awesome party!
Are you going to go?

00:10:11.043 --> 00:10:13.012
Of course! It's going to be an awesome party!

00:10:13.012 --> 00:10:15.742
Great! Bring your swimsuit. He's got a pool!

00:10:16.215 --> 00:10:19.412
But it'll be cold at night.
It's on the roof of some building, right?

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:27.748
What the?! You're so cold.

00:10:38.638 --> 00:10:40.538
Rachel! Claire!

00:10:41.841 --> 00:10:43.138
Dammit!

00:10:44.844 --> 00:10:46.607
Rachel, hurry!

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:52.347
Rachel!

00:10:53.753 --> 00:10:55.050
Kate!

00:11:02.161 --> 00:11:04.629
Somebody! Help!

00:11:11.037 --> 00:11:12.834
NO!

00:11:28.921 --> 00:11:30.786
Rachel! Get this thing's hands off you!

00:12:19.071 --> 00:12:20.368
Rachel!

00:12:51.504 --> 00:12:52.705
Well, they did it.

00:12:52.705 --> 00:12:53.967
We'll see...

00:12:54.106 --> 00:12:55.733
It was their first time.

00:12:56.675 --> 00:12:57.972
Let's go.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:10.020
I overslept again today.

00:13:10.556 --> 00:13:12.725
What do you do? After what
happened last night...

00:13:12.725 --> 00:13:15.888
This is going to be trouble.
I've already got a lot of tickets.

00:13:16.262 --> 00:13:18.856
Why don't you get a permission slip
from the nurse's office?

00:13:19.064 --> 00:13:20.232
I'll go with you.

00:13:20.232 --> 00:13:22.700
Thanks! You're a lifesaver!

00:13:23.002 --> 00:13:25.971
This morning I hurried and fixed my lunch.

00:13:25.971 --> 00:13:28.507
But Carrie was watching TV.

00:13:28.507 --> 00:13:30.176
Was everything okay? After all that...

00:13:30.176 --> 00:13:32.578
Oh, that's right! I saw this bulletin board.

00:13:32.578 --> 00:13:37.116
The city's youth chorus is putting
on a concert at our school!

00:13:37.116 --> 00:13:37.616
Rose?

00:13:37.616 --> 00:13:38.384
Oh, I need to tell Sara!
Rose?

00:13:38.384 --> 00:13:39.752
Oh, I need to tell Sara!

00:13:39.752 --> 00:13:42.254
She never pays attention to the bulletin boards.

00:13:42.254 --> 00:13:43.656
Are you listening to me, Rose?

00:13:43.656 --> 00:13:47.353
She loves concerts too! If I don't tell her soon...

00:13:49.662 --> 00:13:51.129
Are you all right?

00:13:51.463 --> 00:13:52.698
I just...

00:13:52.698 --> 00:13:54.200
You need to take it easy.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:59.502
I couldn't sleep last night either.
My hands are still shaking...

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.075
Those glowing eyes...

00:14:03.075 --> 00:14:05.044
Just thinking about them makes me feel sick.

00:14:05.044 --> 00:14:05.945
Whenever I close my eyes...

00:14:05.945 --> 00:14:07.046
Stop it!

00:14:07.046 --> 00:14:11.278
I see that dog-like thing crawling on
the ground, coming after me.

00:14:12.218 --> 00:14:14.386
He comes closer, his mouth gaping open...

00:14:14.386 --> 00:14:15.554
Stop it!

00:14:15.554 --> 00:14:17.823
And now matter how hard I try to run
away, he's chasing me down.

00:14:17.823 --> 00:14:20.860
Even if I try to think about something else,
I keep seeing those eyes.

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:21.794
Those burning eyes...

00:14:21.794 --> 00:14:22.852
Stop it!
Those burning eyes...

00:14:23.963 --> 00:14:27.160
Rachel, why didn't you go yesterday?

00:14:27.433 --> 00:14:30.402
Did you have your cell turned off?
I kept trying to call you.

00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:32.805
Oh, really? Sorry.

00:14:32.805 --> 00:14:35.708
I laid down for a bit to take a quick nap,
but I ended up sleeping until morning.

00:14:35.708 --> 00:14:36.642
Are you kidding me?

00:14:36.642 --> 00:14:37.743
I really wanted to go.

00:14:37.743 --> 00:14:40.212
I'm telling you, yesterday was incredible!

00:14:40.212 --> 00:14:42.407
Well, at any rate, Sam was an incredible idiot!

00:14:42.481 --> 00:14:43.816
So he did end up coming.

00:14:43.816 --> 00:14:45.918
Even with Luke there, he was all,
"Rachel this and Rachel that..."

00:14:45.918 --> 00:14:46.518
Wasn't he?!
Even with Luke there, he was all,
"Rachel this and Rachel that..."

00:14:46.518 --> 00:14:47.019
Wasn't he?!
It was pathetic.

00:14:47.019 --> 00:14:48.020
It was pathetic.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:50.322
I wish I had been there to see it.
I'll be at the next one.

00:14:50.322 --> 00:14:51.023
Friday's?

00:14:51.023 --> 00:14:51.590
Yeah...
Friday's?

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.024
Yeah...
Are we sneaking out at 1:00
in the morning again?

00:14:52.024 --> 00:14:52.858
Are we sneaking out at 1:00
in the morning again?

00:14:52.858 --> 00:14:54.226
I don't know about that.

00:14:54.226 --> 00:14:55.895
Even if we get there around that time...

00:14:55.895 --> 00:14:59.797
That's when Andrew's parties
usually start to die down!

00:15:00.165 --> 00:15:01.655
What do you think, Rachel?

00:15:02.768 --> 00:15:04.235
Rachel?

00:15:11.911 --> 00:15:14.106
Hey, it's dangerous to stand around here.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:16.778
Big trucks are always flying down this road.

00:15:17.783 --> 00:15:18.951
I...

00:15:18.951 --> 00:15:20.052
Huh?

00:15:20.052 --> 00:15:23.852
Last night, there was an accident
around here, wasn't there?

00:15:24.189 --> 00:15:29.695
An accident? I've been driving these
streets since morning,

00:15:29.695 --> 00:15:31.330
but I haven't seen a thing.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.131
Really...

00:15:32.131 --> 00:15:32.531
It is dangerous here.
Really...

00:15:32.531 --> 00:15:33.465
It is dangerous here.

00:15:33.465 --> 00:15:35.330
Do want me to give you a ride
to the tram station?

00:15:36.101 --> 00:15:37.295
Nah...

00:15:42.107 --> 00:15:44.710
Then that leads to that story that
I've told you a hundred times.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.745
You and that story, you've been telling
it ever since you were in Chicago,

00:15:46.745 --> 00:15:48.714
just because it was a hit there.

00:15:48.714 --> 00:15:52.818
Well, these two haven't heard it.
Most people laugh at that story.

00:15:52.818 --> 00:15:56.777
Think about me! If I hear, "Speaking of Cactus..."

00:15:56.889 --> 00:15:59.255
I'm putting my drink down and
heading for the ladies' room.

00:15:59.558 --> 00:16:02.152
We've already heard it too, haven't we?

00:16:02.895 --> 00:16:03.195
Yeah...

00:16:03.195 --> 00:16:04.096
Huh? Really? Fine, you girls should
tell me some of your stories.
Yeah...

00:16:04.096 --> 00:16:08.667
Huh? Really? Fine, you girls should
tell me some of your stories.

00:16:08.667 --> 00:16:11.397
Did anything good happen while I was away?

00:16:11.637 --> 00:16:14.765
I guess, if you don't mind being surprised.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.842
Whoa! So, you do have a story!

00:16:16.842 --> 00:16:17.710
This is something good, right?

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:18.768
Well...

00:16:19.078 --> 00:16:20.746
I don't want to hear it if it's a story about

00:16:20.746 --> 00:16:22.982
wanting to buy a different car
or something like that!

00:16:22.982 --> 00:16:23.983
You!

00:16:23.983 --> 00:16:25.348
No, this is nothing of the sort!

00:16:25.651 --> 00:16:27.386
Well, don't keep us waiting!

00:16:27.386 --> 00:16:29.354
Okay, I'm not going to beat
around the bush then.

00:16:30.222 --> 00:16:34.158
I might not look it, but I don't really
like surprises! So be nice!

00:16:35.227 --> 00:16:37.855
There is someone that I'd
like to have you meet.

00:16:39.498 --> 00:16:42.990
He's this really nice guy that I work with.

00:16:43.902 --> 00:16:45.665
And he's definitely good at his job.

00:16:47.106 --> 00:16:51.099
Whoa, stop right there. This is quite a shock...

00:16:51.677 --> 00:16:55.135
Hey! Take it a little easy on the booze, okay?

00:16:55.748 --> 00:16:58.308
Actually, this day is starting to look
like it was made for drinking.

00:16:58.817 --> 00:17:03.122
Remember, he works for your company! So, you
shouldn't have any problem with him, right?

00:17:03.122 --> 00:17:05.181
That isn't what bothers me.

00:17:06.759 --> 00:17:07.659
The thing is that...

00:17:07.659 --> 00:17:08.819
What's the matter?

00:17:09.094 --> 00:17:11.562
Excuse me, I need to go to the ladies' room.

00:17:15.167 --> 00:17:17.567
Look, she's shaken up too.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:22.530
Serious things like this take time for planning
and making arrangements.

00:17:22.708 --> 00:17:24.232
You're blowing things out of proportion.

00:17:42.127 --> 00:17:43.492
I'll say this one more time.

00:17:44.263 --> 00:17:47.232
You have all died once.
You're now living borrowed lives.

00:17:47.232 --> 00:17:50.326
That is the only thing keeping
you rooted to this world.

00:18:07.319 --> 00:18:08.616
Is this yours?

00:18:09.288 --> 00:18:11.017
Never leave your personal
belongings at the scene.

00:18:12.491 --> 00:18:15.824
Battles like you fought tonight
are going to continue.

00:18:16.728 --> 00:18:21.131
That is the new night given to you,
who've been born again.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:41.513
I will call you again before midnight,
just like I did tonight.

00:18:42.087 --> 00:18:46.148
If you don't hear from me by then, that means
you don't have to fight that night.

00:18:47.226 --> 00:18:49.786
That is the contract between you and us.

00:18:53.031 --> 00:18:56.489
If you break our contract, then you will truly die.

00:18:56.668 --> 00:18:58.103
Trying to escape is futile.

00:18:58.103 --> 00:19:01.231
Regardless, you will fight.
Moreover, you will continue to win your battles.

00:19:02.241 --> 00:19:05.335
This is the sole path before you.

00:19:21.727 --> 00:19:27.599
Negai sae mo atae rarezu nanigoto ga erareru
What could you gain

00:19:27.599 --> 00:19:32.593
Negai sae mo atae rarezu nanigoto ga erareru
When you can't even give hope?

00:19:33.472 --> 00:19:45.150
Taeyasui to katararezu ni nanigoto mo hatasazu
If easily endured, unspoken, nothing is gained

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:48.086
Imi wo motome
What does this mean?

00:19:48.086 --> 00:19:56.516
Tsuyoku omoi mokusuru koto mo naku
I feel so strongly, I can't keep my thoughts silent

00:19:56.862 --> 00:20:02.134
Mamanarazu wazuka ni demo
Nothing is going even a little bit right

00:20:02.134 --> 00:20:08.540
Shitagai taru ga yokute
All I can do is be led along

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:20.219
Jiai mo renchi de
To love yourself, and know honor

00:20:20.219 --> 00:20:30.094
Yue ni sagashi yume ochite
Searching with a purpose, dreams fall apart

00:20:31.964 --> 00:20:43.575
Hiai mo kamayuru
Sadness, everything wasting away

00:20:43.575 --> 00:20:57.251
Yue ni fukaku tada kuchite iku
Into nothingness

00:21:19.878 --> 00:21:24.906
I'm...I'm...I'm alive.

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:30.622
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:21:30.622 --> 00:21:32.920
One, two, everybody go!

00:21:41.033 --> 00:21:43.302
Toki wa kita, ima da, sou sa mada da!

00:21:43.302 --> 00:21:45.904
Kikkake wa itsu no hi mo omae no namida

00:21:45.904 --> 00:21:48.006
Hakari urarete tebanasu mainichi ni

00:21:48.006 --> 00:21:50.208
lyake sasu nara hayaku tobe takaku

00:21:50.208 --> 00:21:51.777
Kinou no shippai? Kankei nee!

00:21:51.777 --> 00:21:53.912
Asu e no fuan? Zenzen kankei nee!

00:21:53.912 --> 00:21:56.048
Itsumo taisetsu nanowa kono shunkan

00:21:56.048 --> 00:21:58.642
Dakara it goes up to the top, top, top, top!

00:22:07.159 --> 00:22:08.894
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:08.894 --> 00:22:10.295
Tsudoe doushi yo mada minu

00:22:10.295 --> 00:22:11.363
Yume ga samenu nara

00:22:11.363 --> 00:22:13.131
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:13.131 --> 00:22:14.826
So don't care, babe!

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:18.492
Sono wake wa kikanai kara

00:22:18.637 --> 00:22:22.874
Bokura ga kimi wo mamoru kara

00:22:22.874 --> 00:22:25.510
Kirawaremono de iisa

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:30.082
Warawaretatte shinjita michi wo susume

00:22:30.082 --> 00:22:33.118
Warawaretatte shinjita michi wo susume

00:22:33.118 --> 00:22:35.654
Kimi no sono namida wa

00:22:35.654 --> 00:22:39.991
Sekai ni futatsu to nai takaramono sa

00:22:39.991 --> 00:22:42.928
Nakusanai you ni todoku you ni tada utau yo

00:22:42.928 --> 00:22:50.135
Nakusanai you ni todoku you ni tada utau yo

00:22:50.135 --> 00:22:52.137
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:52.137 --> 00:22:54.239
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:54.239 --> 00:22:56.469
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:23:00.846 --> 00:23:03.974
That night, that place, something happened.

00:23:05.016 --> 00:23:07.177
Flowers bloom and butterflies dance in the sky.

00:23:07.519 --> 00:23:10.322
The girls are now shattered
by their lost memories.

